---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for AI Career Guide.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="mt-8 prose prose-lg max-w-none text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 15, 2026</p>

      <p>
        AI Career Guide (&#34;we&#34;, &#34;our&#34;, or &#34;us&#34;) respects your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Comments & Forms:</strong> If you leave a comment or fill out a contact form, we collect your name, email address, and the message content.</li>
        <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> If you subscribe, we collect your email address to send updates.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> We may use services like Google Analytics to track anonymous usage data (IP anonymised).</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use minimal cookies – e.g., to remember your theme preference (dark/light).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To operate and improve the website.</li>
        <li>To send you newsletters and updates (with your consent).</li>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries.</li>
        <li>To monitor usage and performance.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third‑Party Services</h2>
      <p>
        We may use third‑party services such as Cloudflare, Google Analytics, and email providers. These services have their own privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect your data, but no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can request access, correction, or deletion of your data by contacting us via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the latest version here with the effective date.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy questions, please <a href="/contact">reach out to us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
